02d. Create an irrelevant registration
======================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Content-Length: 0
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/csourceRegistrations/urn:aeros:federation:b:infrastructure4



03. Create an entity matching the subscription
==============================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Content-Length: 0
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/entities/urn:ngsi-ld:vehicle:5g-car:2



04. Dump+Reset the accumulator to see the notification
======================================================
POST http://REGEX(.*)/notify?subscriptionId=urn:aeros:subscription:car:test
Content-Length: 302
User-Agent: orionld/REGEX(.*)
Host: REGEX(.*)
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-contextREGEX(.*)"
Ngsild-Attribute-Format: Normalized

{
    "data": [
        {
            "distanceCollision": {
                "type": "Property",
                "value": 543333
            },
            "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:vehicle:5g-car:2",
            "type": "Vehicle"
        }
    ],
    "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:Notification:REGEX(.*)",
    "notifiedAt": "202REGEX(.*)Z",
    "subscriptionId": "urn:aeros:subscription:car:test",
    "type": "Notification"
}
=======================================


05. PATCH the attribute distanceCollision, to provoke a notification
====================================================================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)



